    {
      "id": "step2-desc",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 500,
      "y": 115,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "Process 6 is killed (HW failure, SEGFAULT, etc).\nP6 was the parent of P7 in the broadcast tree.\nP7 is still alive but UNREACHABLE — messages\nto P7 must route through dead P6.",
