    {
      "id": "step3-code",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 620,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 230,
      "text": "The SLURM script does:\n\n  async with trainers_proc_mesh:\n      await training_actors.start_training.call(...)\n\nWhen call() raises (process died), async with exits\nand calls proc_mesh.stop() for cleanup.\n\nstop() sends through the broadcast tree → hangs\nbecause P6 is dead and P7 can't be reached.\n\nThe ReplicaActor is STUCK in __aexit__.\nThe controller's call_one() hangs.\nThe retry loop never fires.\nThe entire script is frozen.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 302,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "...",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },


    {
      "id": "step4-title",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 880,
      "width": 600,
      "height": 30,
      "text": "SOLUTION: Skip Cleanup — Orphan Pattern",
      "fontSize": 22,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#1864ab",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 401,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "SOLUTION: Skip Cleanup — Orphan Pattern",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "step4-desc",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 920,
      "width": 550,
      "height": 300,
      "text": "Don't use 'async with'. Don't call stop().\nWhen __supervise__ catches the failure:\n\n1. ReplicaActor raises TrainerFailure\n2. Controller catches it\n3. Controller stops the ReplicaActor's LOCAL proc_mesh\n   (on the controller pod — NOT the GPU pod)\n4. The remote training processes lose their owner\n   → they become ORPHANS\n5. Monarch's orphan detection kills them after ~60s\n   (mesh_orphan_timeout)\n6. GPUs are freed\n7. Controller spawns new ReplicaActor\n8. New ReplicaActor calls scheduler.proc_mesh()\n   → hm.spawn_procs() on the same pod\n\n✓ No hang — we never send stop() through broken tree\n✓ No Monarch changes needed\n✗ Orphans hold GPUs for ~60s (can't spawn until freed)",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 402,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "...",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },


    {
      "id": "step5-title",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 1260,
      "width": 600,
      "height": 30,
      "text": "BLOCKER: Stale TCP Session on Reconnect",
      "fontSize": 22,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#c92a2a",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 501,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "BLOCKER: Stale TCP Session on Reconnect",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "step5-desc",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 1300,
      "width": 600,
      "height": 340,
      "text": "The orphan pattern works for the FIRST failure:\n  ✓ __supervise__ catches it\n  ✓ TrainerFailure propagated to controller\n  ✓ ReplicaActor torn down, trainers orphaned\n  ✓ Healthy replica trains solo (490 steps proved)\n\nBut after 90s, the RECONNECT fails:\n\n  New ReplicaActor → scheduler.proc_mesh() → job.state()\n  → hm.spawn_procs({gpus: 8})\n\n  ERROR: \"out-of-sequence message, expected seq 0, got 727\"\n  or: \"Timeout=0..8\"\n\nRoot cause: Monarch's transport layer caches TCP sessions\nby destination address. The first ReplicaActor's session\n(seq 727 after training) persists in the controller's\ntransport cache. The worker pod reset after orphans died\n(expects seq 0). Controller sends seq 727 → rejected.\n\nRepro: repro_stale_session.py (confirmed blocked)\nFiled as Monarch issue — no workaround from user code.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 502,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "...",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },


    {
      "id": "step6-title",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 1680,
      "width": 600,
      "height": 30,
      "text": "TIMELINE: What We Proved Works vs What's Blocked",
      "fontSize": 22,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#862e9c",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 601,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
