      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "TIMELINE: What We Proved Works vs What's Blocked",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "step6-timeline",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 1720,
      "width": 700,
      "height": 280,
      "text": "t=0s     SEGFAULT injected into replica 1, rank 6\nt=0.1s   __supervise__ catches logger, SPMD, training actor failures  ✓\nt=0.1s   TrainerFailure raised → controller catches it               ✓\nt=0.2s   Controller tears down ReplicaActor (orphans trainers)       ✓\nt=0.2s   Controller starts 90s wait for orphan cleanup               ✓\nt=0s-90s Replica 0 continues training SOLO (490 steps!)             ✓\nt=60s    Orphaned processes die (mesh_orphan_timeout)                ✓\nt=90s    Controller spawns new ReplicaActor                          ✓\nt=90s    New ReplicaActor calls scheduler.proc_mesh()                 ✓\nt=90s    hm.spawn_procs() → \"out-of-sequence\" or timeout             ✗ BLOCKED\n\nEverything works EXCEPT the final reconnection.\nThe pod is alive, GPUs are free, worker is ready.\nBut Monarch's cached session blocks the new connection.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
